WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.400
-Welcome back to
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.767
I'm here with Kirk and Tariq
from The Roots.

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:07.534
And we're about to play a game
called "Musical Beers."

00:00:07.534 --> 00:00:09.534
But, first, we're gonna need
a few more players.

00:00:09.534 --> 00:00:11.400
He is the host of
"Celebrity Beef,"

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.968
airing Tuesdays at 10:00 p.m.
on E!

00:00:13.968 --> 00:00:16.200
Give it up for Joel McHale!

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.100
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.033
Joel, back here.
Joel, back here.

00:00:21.033 --> 00:00:24.000
No, Joel, come back.
Joel, come back here.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.133
Come back. No, no.

00:00:25.133 --> 00:00:26.834
They're not --
Joel, thank you very much.

00:00:26.834 --> 00:00:29.901
Stay there. There he goes.
No, no. Stay here.

00:00:29.901 --> 00:00:32.868
Plus, she stars in
the new movie "Not Okay,"

00:00:32.868 --> 00:00:34.901
which is streaming now on Hulu.

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:37.701
Please welcome Zoey Deutch!

00:00:37.701 --> 00:00:39.701
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:47.467
Now, the game works like
musical chairs,

00:00:47.467 --> 00:00:49.067
but instead of diving into
empty chairs,

00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:51.334
we're going to be grabbing
these red cups of beer.

00:00:51.334 --> 00:00:54.434
When the music stops, one person
will be left empty-handed.

00:00:54.434 --> 00:00:56.601
They are out of the game
and have to hangout with our

00:00:56.601 --> 00:01:00.167
DJ up there, DJ Sam the Butcher.

00:01:00.167 --> 00:01:01.467
We're going to do four rounds.

00:01:01.467 --> 00:01:04.267
The last one standing is
the "Musical Beers" champion.

00:01:04.267 --> 00:01:06.934
Everyone, space yourselves out.
Let's get ready.

00:01:06.934 --> 00:01:10.334
When the music stops, that's
when you have to grab your beer.

00:01:10.334 --> 00:01:12.267
-Is it a bad time to mention
that I'm an alcoholic?

00:01:12.267 --> 00:01:14.133
-That's good, Joel.

00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:16.167
No, that's why we
put you in this game.

00:01:16.167 --> 00:01:17.334
-Okay. Thank you.

00:01:17.334 --> 00:01:19.367
♪♪
I'm jonesing.

00:01:19.367 --> 00:01:22.100
-You can move back
a little bit, Zoey.

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:25.968
[ Music slowing ]

00:01:25.968 --> 00:01:30.133
[ Music intensifies, slows ]

00:01:30.133 --> 00:01:32.133
♪♪

00:01:37.133 --> 00:01:39.133
[ Music stops ]

00:01:44.767 --> 00:01:46.334
-Oh, no.

00:01:47.934 --> 00:01:50.100
You take it.
-Well, this one --

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:51.868
-No, no, no. I could never.

00:01:51.868 --> 00:01:52.968
I am the host. I could never.

00:01:52.968 --> 00:01:55.434
Please just drink that
arm beer and...

00:01:55.434 --> 00:01:56.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:01.234 --> 00:02:05.567
♪♪

00:02:05.567 --> 00:02:07.100
Alright, now there
are three beers on there.

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:08.701
Higgins, good job.

00:02:08.701 --> 00:02:11.734
-Oh, really?
-Zoey, do it for us.

00:02:11.734 --> 00:02:13.834
Come on, bud.

00:02:13.834 --> 00:02:16.133
Joel, good luck. Whoa.

00:02:16.133 --> 00:02:19.501
Be careful!
You never know, Kirk.

00:02:19.501 --> 00:02:22.067
You're too competitive, buddy.
Oh, my God.

00:02:22.067 --> 00:02:24.934
Tariq, do not touch that.

00:02:24.934 --> 00:02:26.267
Whoa!
[ Music stops ]

00:02:26.267 --> 00:02:28.934
It did stop. It stopped! Yes!

00:02:28.934 --> 00:02:30.400
-What?!

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:32.501
[ Indistinct shouting ]

00:02:32.501 --> 00:02:34.100
-Go, Joel!
Kirk, come up here with me.

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:35.667
-Damn.
-Yeah, come on, Kirk.

00:02:35.667 --> 00:02:36.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:36.667 --> 00:02:37.767
-I ain't going out
like that again.

00:02:37.767 --> 00:02:40.767
-[ Laughs ]
-Whoo!

00:02:40.767 --> 00:02:43.000
Oh, my gosh.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:44.434
-I'm pretty drunk now.

00:02:44.434 --> 00:02:47.267
-Alright, Joel, the garbage can
is in the middle,

00:02:47.267 --> 00:02:48.300
not our stage.

00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:50.334
Thank you very much.
Okay, here we go.

00:02:50.334 --> 00:02:53.801
♪♪

00:02:53.801 --> 00:02:54.934
It's going faster now.
Here we go.

00:02:54.934 --> 00:02:56.701
Good luck, everybody.

00:02:56.701 --> 00:03:00.300
Tariq's been practicing.
Oh, my God.

00:03:05.534 --> 00:03:07.801
[ Music slows ]

00:03:07.801 --> 00:03:10.901
No. It's not stopped.
Keep going. Keep going.

00:03:10.901 --> 00:03:11.934
It didn't stop!
It's just slow.

00:03:11.934 --> 00:03:13.434
He's messing with your mind.

00:03:13.434 --> 00:03:14.934
[ Music stops ]
Oh!

00:03:14.934 --> 00:03:16.901
Wow!
[ Sad tuba plays ]

00:03:16.901 --> 00:03:18.601
-[ Groans ]

00:03:20.701 --> 00:03:22.567
-That's all right.
We'll take care of you.

00:03:22.567 --> 00:03:24.200
-Aah!

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:27.601
-Alright, the last cup
has been placed.

00:03:27.601 --> 00:03:30.701
It's Zoey versus Tariq
for the champ, "Musical Beers."

00:03:30.701 --> 00:03:32.000
Zoey, you know
who I'm rooting for.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:33.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:35.033 --> 00:03:36.367
DJ Fievel goes West,
let's do it.

00:03:36.367 --> 00:03:38.367
[ Slow carnival music playing ]

00:03:39.501 --> 00:03:41.334
-This is terrifying music.

00:03:41.334 --> 00:03:43.434
-Yeah, why does it
have to be so spooky?

00:03:43.434 --> 00:03:45.400
-He plays birthday parties,
bar mitzvahs.

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:47.000
Whatever you need, he's there.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.767
-It's haunting.

00:03:54.234 --> 00:03:58.601
-Oh, my God. Take it seriously!

00:03:58.601 --> 00:04:02.033
-Take beer
musical chairs seriously!

00:04:02.033 --> 00:04:06.434
[ Music intensifies ]
-Aah! Aah! Aah! Aah!

00:04:06.434 --> 00:04:08.701
[ Music slows ]
-Oh, my God.

00:04:08.701 --> 00:04:09.834
Tariq, you can't just
stand there.

00:04:09.834 --> 00:04:11.801
-I'm scared! I'm afraid!

00:04:11.801 --> 00:04:13.334
[ Music stops ]
Aah!

00:04:13.334 --> 00:04:15.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:15.434 --> 00:04:17.234
-The winner!
-It's really you.

00:04:17.234 --> 00:04:18.701
You have to finish this.
[ Dinging ]

00:04:18.701 --> 00:04:23.167
♪♪

00:04:23.167 --> 00:04:24.734
I don't know, but was that fair?
'Cause you really --

00:04:24.734 --> 00:04:26.534
-Yes. Come on, bud.

00:04:26.534 --> 00:04:29.367
Our thanks to Joel McHale,
Zoey Deutch, the champ!

00:04:29.367 --> 00:04:32.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:32.033 --> 00:04:33.968
We're talking to Joel McHale
after the break.

00:04:33.968 --> 00:04:35.367
Stick around, everybody.
Come on back.

00:04:35.367 --> 00:04:36.467
Of course that's fair.
-I don't know.

